---
description: Always follow this repo's AGENTS.md and SKILLS.md
alwaysApply: true
---

Read and follow `AGENTS.md` and `SKILLS.md` before changing code.

- Max 150 lines per file; extract with `SKILL-refactor-component.md`.
- No hardcoded UI strings — `next-intl` (`getTranslations` / `useTranslations`).
- No `any`. No nested ternaries. No `import React from "react"`.
- `"use client"` only when required. Avoid `useEffect` unless syncing with an external system.
- New components: PascalCase. Utils: kebab-case. Enums: Microsoft PascalCase.
- After structural edits: `npx tsc --noEmit` and `npx biome check --write .`.
- Read the scoped `AGENTS.md` in `src/app/`, `src/components/`, `src/features/`, `src/lib/`, or `src/app/api/` when working in those trees.
